yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# System and IDE files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# Applications
*.app
*.exe
*.war

# Large media files
*.mp4
*.tiff
*.avi
*.flv
*.mov
*.wmv

walkthrough.md
task.
walkthrough_Job_listing_frontend.md
backend_architecture_Job_listing_walkthrough.md

